      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-australian-consumer-law-review-act-2018.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to findings of\nfact, and admissions of fact, made on or after the commencement of this\nSchedule.\n\nSchedule 2  Listed public companies\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Australian Consumer Law Review) Act\nNo. 132, 2018",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to findings of\nfact, and admissions of fact, made on or after the commencement of this\nSchedule.\n\nSchedule 2  Listed public companies\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Australian Consumer Law Review) Act\nNo. 132, 2018",
