      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by Schedule 4 to the Treasury Laws\nAmendment (Australian Consumer Law Review) Act 2018 applies\nin relation to acts or omissions that relate to agreements entered\ninto on or after the day that Schedule commences."
    },
